            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani waan Rebekaani Isaaqooni jette, Anini waan dubarti Hiti na tolchite ya obsu dad'abe. Yo Yakoboleeni dubra Hiti fuud'e dua male woma na inhamne.",
          "type": "text",
